[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_0010","text":"‘外景要好好拍哦’"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_0020","text":"‘和街上的人们好好享受哦～’"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_0030","text":"────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_0040","text":"哦，看起来很开心啊\n说了什么？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_0050","text":"是冬优子酱和爱依酱发来的\n她们给我加油了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_0060","text":"哈哈，那就好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_0070","text":"好，到了\n我去停车，再等一下啊——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_9901","text":"节目导演"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_0080","text":"──今天你可以自由走动\n朝日酱想去哪里就去哪里，好吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_0090","text":"自由行动，是吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_0100","text":"剧本，没写的地方好多啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_9902","text":"节目导演"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_0110","text":"嗯，全交给朝日酱了！\n因为是街拍外景嘛，所以没搞得太死板"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_0120","text":"原来如此！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_9903","text":"节目导演"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_0130","text":"因为想拍出朝日酱自己的风格嘛\n照你平时的感觉，随心所欲就好！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_0140","text":"随心所欲…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_0150","text":"朝日？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_0160","text":"啊……\n没什么"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_9904","text":"节目导演"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_0170","text":"那，差不多该开拍啦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_0180","text":"拜托了！\n──朝日，加油啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_0190","text":"好的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_0191","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_9905","text":"SNS的帖子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01050200_00_0200","text":"‘芹泽朝日，太自由了……讨厌’"}]
